  29  * 1 Set definition
  30  *==============================================================================
  31  * The sets are defined in the DATA_AGG-2007.gms file and are stored in the
  32  * DATA_AGG-2007.GDX output file. Any changes in the aggregation of industries
  33  * and/or region is thus automatically taken into account in the current file.
