3730                   PWX(i,z,zj) =e= PWM(i,z,zj);
3731   
3732   EQ79(i)..       SUM[z$MRGNO(i,z),MRGN(i,z)] =e= SUM[(z,zj,ij)$IMO(ij,zj,z),
3733                                                   tmrg(i,ij,zj,z)*IM(ij,zj,z)];
3734   
3735  * Given equations 33, 34 and 77, equation 80 is redundant
