4062  *==============================================================================
4063  * numeraire shock
4064  *==============================================================================
      Parameter numeraire;
      * In the default specification, the numeraire is equal to the
      * reference region's GDP deflator:
      * numeraire = SUM[zr,PIXGDPO(zr)];
      * In the preceding expression, the sum is taken over the set zr,
      * which contains a single element.
       
      * Next, assign the numeraire any desired value.
      * For example
      numeraire = 1.2*SUM[zr,PIXGDPO(zr)];
      * Then apply the closure rules
      PIXGDP.FX(zr) = numeraire;
      e.FX(z) = numeraire*eO(z);
       
      SOLVE PEPW1 USING CNS;
       
